{"title": "Fiendish Fire", "pageid": 27950, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fiendish_Fire", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Fiendish Fire</b> is a passive feature that can reveal enemies and make them easier to hit.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per turn, a creature hit by this weapon will possibly be afflicted with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faerie_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Faerie Fire (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Faerie Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Faerie_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Faerie Fire (Condition)\">Faerie Fire</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Faerie_Fire\"> Condition: Faerie Fire </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faerie_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Faerie Fire (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Faerie Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Faerie_Fire_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Faerie_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Faerie Fire (Condition)\">Faerie Fire</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DEX Save (DC&nbsp;13)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;13)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Shedding dim light. Incoming attacks have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a>. Cannot be <a href=\"/wiki/Condition#Invisible\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition\">Invisible</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellrider_Longbow\" title=\"Hellrider Longbow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hellrider_Longbow\" title=\"Hellrider Longbow\">Hellrider Longbow</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Faerie Fire condition is only applied for one turn, and is removed at the start of the target's next turn, effectively being only useful on the turn it is applied.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>While the <b>Fiendish Fire</b> saving throw triggers on all damage dealt by the wielder (including spells and other weapons), the effect is only actually applied if the damage originates from this specific weapon. If the target fails the save against a spell or a different melee attack, the status effect will not be inflicted.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201919\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1685/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18035/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4699/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936538/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.439      1 Template:Passiv